 supersaints assembled to go to behold the encounter taking place between the two cars.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.868,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-106-11"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6094013","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"da0b7f4802620ebb14dd77e668d87a51dd3c6d27fc32a5482ef39b6e00a96e23","compact":"4d6140bc27532a7867dae6aefe8bda0ad3df7555e2cb4a560ca48bef8b68d215","nasal":"b02163fca16c4e9f7ead4c02038041152aa4893ebd632b1e934d53973a143999"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-94-14","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":94,"verse":14,"english":"For the destruction of Råvana and the success of Rāghava, there occurred round about the cars terrible bodements capable of making people's down stand on end. as","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.755,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-106-12"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6094014","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"bbcf3c8714539635c02ee0334f598ce33c40fdf4e5af13f5fd4f484af80b55ff","compact":"429c3895ff6d09c2373e5425275c653e1e927283ed841e152c8a4ad9f91946c0","nasal":"429c3895ff6d09c2373e5425275c653e1e927283ed841e152c8a4ad9f91946c0"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-94-15","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":94,"verse":15,"english":"The god poured down showers of blood on the car of Rāvana; and a violent tornado eddied on his right.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.807,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-106-13"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6094015","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"776a34af52b363976748ab5c88421faae761b960d5bc0b948eac9865576702e4","compact":"b62fef65753b55633019a0b9e3535e881fcc3dc85d67afb16847f53bfc6acc3b","nasal":"775853a5dd011dbfe231209b500afd280b688681d2f3cb997506fb2ecdde7824"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-9